    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "2. Some direction words\n\nKo-, so-, and a- can also be used to indicate direction, as in:\n\nkochira OR kotchi    this way (refers to the direction of the speaker)\nsochira OR sotchi    that way (refers to the direction of the listener)\nachira OR atchi      that way over there (refers to a direction away from the speaker and listener)"
    }
